# Rootweave Caves (CIPlay rootweave_caves): the Fungus Hall (mouth 0 -45), the turbine's mast box on the hilltop, the
# Bee Hall (mouth 42 4), the Flooded Passage (mouth -48 -8, under the sea), the Den (mouth -4 44) and its mama bear.
island Rootweave Caves
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Living Labyrinth
zone fungus_hall
expect step 1
read Cave survey
expect step 2
open Turbine mast box
wait 3
expect step 3
zone bee_hall
expect step 4
expect hidden beecache
use beevines
expect shown beecache
open Bee hall cache
wait 3
expect step 5
zone flooded_passage
expect step 6
open Drowned crate
wait 3
expect step 7
kill Mama bear
expect animals Mama bear 0
expect step 8
open Den cache
wait 3
expect step 9
expect hidden labchest
use fusebox
expect story fuse 0
expect shown labchest
expect step 10
open Lab chest
wait 3
expect step 11
read Poison sample report
expect done
